# Design Project
project_id=project_1783253820828_24440_6
title=Runtime Evidence CLI Smoke
genre=2D action adventure
player_promise=玩家通过快速探索、精准战斗和持续成长获得清晰反馈
quality_score=1.00
requires_ai_intervention=false

## Core Loop
1. 探索关卡并发现风险
2. 使用核心能力解决战斗或机关
3. 获得反馈、资源和新目标

## Design Pillars
- name=Player Promise; rationale=玩家通过快速探索、精准战斗和持续成长获得清晰反馈
- name=Genre Fit; rationale=2D action adventure systems must reinforce the core loop instead of adding unrelated scope
- name=Readable Feedback; rationale=Every important action must produce visible state change and player-facing feedback

## Gameplay Mechanics
- name=Core Loop Mechanic 1; player_action=探索关卡并发现风险; feedback=Record state change and feedback for: 探索关卡并发现风险
- name=Core Loop Mechanic 2; player_action=使用核心能力解决战斗或机关; feedback=Record state change and feedback for: 使用核心能力解决战斗或机关
- name=Core Loop Mechanic 3; player_action=获得反馈、资源和新目标; feedback=Record state change and feedback for: 获得反馈、资源和新目标

## Playable Scenarios
- scenario_id=scenario_core_loop_step_1; entry=fresh_session_with_default_content; goal=execute_and_understand_core_loop_step_1; critical_path=探索关卡并发现风险; success=core_loop_step_1_produces_state_change_and_feedback; failure=player_cannot_identify_result_of_core_loop_step_1; validation_probe=probe_core_loop_step_1_input_state_feedback
- scenario_id=scenario_core_loop_step_2; entry=after_core_loop_step_1; goal=execute_and_understand_core_loop_step_2; critical_path=使用核心能力解决战斗或机关; success=core_loop_step_2_produces_state_change_and_feedback; failure=player_cannot_identify_result_of_core_loop_step_2; validation_probe=probe_core_loop_step_2_input_state_feedback
- scenario_id=scenario_core_loop_step_3; entry=after_core_loop_step_2; goal=execute_and_understand_core_loop_step_3; critical_path=获得反馈、资源和新目标; success=core_loop_step_3_produces_state_change_and_feedback; failure=player_cannot_identify_result_of_core_loop_step_3; validation_probe=probe_core_loop_step_3_input_state_feedback

## Acceptance Risks
- risk=scope_drift; mitigation=Reject mechanics that do not support the declared player promise
- risk=feedback_unclear; mitigation=Require each loop step to declare visible or audio feedback
